## The sidecar joins the cluster as a hidden node: it does not show up in the
## application's Node.list/0 and does not take part in the full mesh.
-hidden

## At most 65536 ports. Without it, the VM sizes its port table from the
## open-files limit, which recent systemd and some container runtimes
## (containerd 2.x, kind) set to about a billion: it then reserves gigabytes at
## start, and a memory limit gets it killed. The sidecar needs few ports.
+Q 65536
